(Reducing Appointment No-shows: What the Research Says) Tj T*
(A whitepaper by Remindly Research, 2025) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Summary) Tj T*
(Missed appointments cost healthcare providers between 5% and 15% of capacity. Across 31) Tj T*
(published studies, automated reminders reduced no-shows by a median of 29%. Two) Tj T*
(reminders \(one 2-3 days before, one on the day\) worked better than one.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What works) Tj T*
(- Reminders that include an easy way to cancel or move the appointment.) Tj T*
(- Messages in the patient's own language.) Tj T*
(- Sending reminders at a time the patient is likely to read them, for example 18:00.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(What does not work) Tj T*
(- Charging a no-show fee without a reminder; it harms trust and barely changes) Tj T*
(behaviour.) Tj T*
(- Long messages with legal text.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
